{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34326","headline":"忆袭美洞庭观步奉和次韵 · 陆龟蒙","name":"忆袭美洞庭观步奉和次韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻君游静境，雅具更摐摐。\n竹伞遮云径，藤鞋踏藓矼。\n杖斑花不一，尊大瘿成双。\n水鸟行沙屿，山僧礼石幢。\n已甘三秀味，谁念百牢腔。\n远棹投何处，残阳到几窗。\n仙谣珠树曲，村饷白醅[缸]。\n地里方吴会，人风似冉厖。\n探幽非遯世，寻胜肯迷邦。\n爲读江南传，何贤过二庞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34326.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34326","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}